					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13387129#post-4668769</guid>
				<title>Couple things to correct</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13387129/sunfire#post-4668769</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 30 May 2020 02:12:18 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>pxdnbluesoul</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1414125</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Stand with massive, brightly-colored overhangs that shone purple, pink, and red in the sun swayed with the wind.</p> </blockquote> <p>I can't follow this sentence to try and make a corrective edit on.</p> <blockquote> <p>Sarie's gaze drifted up as she fantasized, eventually landing on a dark which was rapidly taking form in the sky.</p> </blockquote> <p>A dark..?</p> <p>And less a correction and more of a thing that made me scratch my head:</p> <blockquote> <p>It was yellow, and as thick as a god's handkerchief.</p> </blockquote> <p>Not sure that a handkerchief makes a lot of sense as a point of comparison with a meteor?? It wasn't until we get further along in the piece that the comparison does make sense and that makes it flow poorly. It would be a good opportunity for some introspection, showing some bafflement on the part of the character in the piece so one doesn't wonder if they've misread something in the piece.</p> <p>+1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
